Channel your mental power through your wielded mindstars, generating psionic blades.

Mindstar psiblades have their damage modifiers (how much damage they gain from stats) multiplied by (1.076 + 0.324 * √ Talent Level), their armour penetration by (0.65 + 0.51 * √ Talent Level) and mindpower, willpower and cunning by (1.076 + 0.324 * √ Talent Level).

Also increases Physical Power by 30 and increases weapon damage by 100 * √ (Talent Level / 5) / 1.5 % when using mindstars.

''Note: The damage bonus from this talent applies to the base Willpower and Cunning modifiers on the mindstar, not any other stat-based damage you may have. For example, the +50% magic modifier from the {{t|Arcane Might}} prodigy and the +40% willpower modifier from the {{t|Superpower}} prodigy will not be increased.'''
